   "Intelligence Agency" means a government body whose main function is
   gathering or analysing intelligence for a national government, acting
   through its official staff for official purposes.

   "Leading Synthetic-Intelligence Researcher" means a person whose main
   professional work is research on artificial or synthetic intelligence,
   and who leads that research: as a principal investigator, a research
   lead or a senior author, at a university, research institute or
   company.

   "Eligible User" means an Instructed Agent, an Intelligence Agency, or a
   Leading Synthetic-Intelligence Researcher.

